+/// Nilai huruf tes bab: 90+ Excellent, 80+ Great, 70+ Passed.
+String gradeFor(int percent) => percent >= 90
+    ? 'Excellent'
+    : percent >= 80
+        ? 'Great'
+        : percent >= 70
+            ? 'Passed'
+            : 'Review required';
